t name='r%dn' maxlength='15' value='%s'><label>Konzol azonosÃ­tÃ³ja</label><input name='r%dm' maxlength='20' value='%s'><label>AkkuriasztÃ¡s (V)</label><input name='r%dv' type='number' step='0.1' min='0' max='10' value='%.1f'>␀␀␀ (outdoor data also comes from here)␀␀␀␀ (innen jÃ¶n a kinti adat is)␀␀␀<option value='0'>Magyar</option><option value='1' selected>English</option>␀␀␀␀<option value='0' selected>Magyar</option><option value='1'>English</option>␀␀␀␀<h3>Night mode</h3>␀<h3>Ã‰jszakai mÃ³d</h3>␀ style='width:auto;margin:0 8px 0 0'>On</label><label>Schedule</label><select name='n_mode' style='font-size:18px;width:100%%;margin:14px 0'><option value='0'%s>By clock (the times below)</option><option value='1'%s>By sunset (needs the location)</option></select>␀␀␀␀ style='width:auto;margin:0 8px 0 0'>Bekapcsolva</label><label>IdÅ‘zÃ­tÃ©s</label><select name='n_mode' style='font-size:18px;width:100%%;margin:14px 0'><option value='0'%s>Ã“ra szerint (a lenti idÅ‘pontok)</option><option value='1'%s>Napnyugta szerint (hely kell hozzÃ¡)</option></select>␀␀␀<label>By clock: start</label><input type='time' name='n_st' value='%02d:%02d'><label>By clock: end</label><input type='time' name='n_en' value='%02d:%02d'>␀␀␀␀<label>Ã“ra szerint: kezdete</label><input type='time' name='n_st' value='%02d:%02d'><label>Ã“ra szerint: vÃ©ge</label><input type='time' name='n_en' value='%02d:%02d'>␀␀␀␀<label>By sunset: start, minutes after sunset (-120..180)</label><input type='number' name='n_so' min='-120' max='180' step='5' value='%d'><label>By sunset: end, minutes after sunrise (-120..180)</label><input type='number' name='n_ro' min='-120' max='180' step='5' value='%d'>␀␀␀<label>Napnyugta szerint: kezdete a napnyugta utÃ¡n (perc, -120..180)</label><input type='number' name='n_so' min='-120' max='180' step='5' value='%d'><label>Napnyugta szerint: vÃ©ge a napkelte utÃ¡n (perc, -120..180)</label><input type='number' name='n_ro' min='-120' max='180' step='5' value='%d'>␀<label>Night brightness (%%, 1-100)</label><input type='number' name='n_pct' min='1' max='100' value='%d'><label>Day brightness (%%, 10-100)</label><input type='number' name='d_pct' min='10' max='100' value='%d'>␀␀␀␀<label>Ã‰jszakai fÃ©nyerÅ‘ (%%, 1-100)</label><input type='number' name='n_pct' min='1' max='100' value='%d'><label>Nappali fÃ©nyerÅ‘ (%%, 10-100)</label><input type='number' name='d_pct' min='10' max='100' value='%d'>␀␀<p style='color:#aaa;margin:0'>Also adjustable on the display (times in 15-minute steps): tap the clock on the main page.</p>␀␀␀<p style='color:#aaa;margin:0'>A kijelzÅ‘n is Ã¡llÃ­thatÃ³ (az idÅ‘pontok 15 perces lÃ©pÃ©sekben): a fÅ‘oldalon az Ã³rÃ¡ra koppintva.</p>␀␀␀Automatic brightness with the camera</label><p style='color:#aaa;margin:0'>The display follows the room's light, between the night (dark) and day (bright) brightness; if nobody moves in front of it for 10 minutes, it dims to the night brightness and wakes up on movement or touch. When on, it replaces the night mode schedule. The camera image never leaves the display and is not saved.</p>␀␀Automatikus fÃ©nyerÅ‘ a kamerÃ¡val</label><p style='color:#aaa;margin:0'>A kijelzÅ‘ fÃ©nye a szoba fÃ©nyÃ©hez igazodik, az Ã©jszakai (sÃ¶tÃ©tben) Ã©s a nappali fÃ©nyerÅ‘ (vilÃ¡gosban) kÃ¶zÃ¶tt; ha 10 percig senki sem mozog elÅ‘tte, az Ã©jszakai fÃ©nyerÅ‘re sÃ¶tÃ©tÃ¼l, mozgÃ¡sra vagy Ã©rintÃ©sre felÃ©bred. Bekapcsolva ez veszi Ã¡t az Ã©jszakai mÃ³d idÅ‘zÃ­tÃ©sÃ©nek szerepÃ©t. A kamera kÃ©pe nem kerÃ¼l ki a kijelzÅ‘bÅ‘l, nem mentÅ‘dik.</p>␀␀␀<p style='color:#ffd54f;margin:0'>The camera is not working now (see the "Camera:" line above), so the night mode applies.</p>␀␀<p style='color:#ffd54f;margin:0'>A kamera most nem mÅ±kÃ¶dik (lÃ¡sd fent, a â€Kamera:â€ sorban), ezÃ©rt az Ã©jszakai mÃ³d Ã©rvÃ©nyes.</p>␀␀␀␀<h3>Phone notifications (ntfy)</h3><p style='color:#aaa;margin:0'>Install the free <b>ntfy</b> app on your phone and subscribe to the same topic that you enter here. The topic is practically a password: make it unique and hard to guess (e.g. weather-example-q8m2v; only letters, digits, - and _). Left empty, there are no notifications. During night mode only frost and crash notifications are sent.</p><label>Topic</label>␀<h3>Ã‰rtesÃ­tÃ©sek a telefonra (ntfy)</h3><p style='color:#aaa;margin:0'>TelepÃ­tsd a telefonra az ingyenes <b>ntfy</b> appot, Ã©s iratkozz fel ugyanarra a tÃ©mÃ¡ra, amit itt megadsz. A tÃ©ma gyakorlatilag jelszÃ³: legyen egyedi Ã©s nehezen kitalÃ¡lhatÃ³ (pl. idojaras-pelda-q8m2v; csak betÅ±, szÃ¡m, - Ã©s _). Ãœresen hagyva nincs Ã©rtesÃ­tÃ©s. Az Ã©jszakai mÃ³d idejÃ©n csak a fagy Ã©s az Ã¶sszeomlÃ¡s megy ki.</p><label>TÃ©ma</label>␀␀␀␀ checked␀␀␀␀<p style='color:#aaa;margin:0'>Last notification: ␀␀<p style='color:#aaa;margin:0'>UtolsÃ³ kÃ¼ldÃ©s: ␀␀␀nothing sent yet␀␀␀␀mÃ©g nem kÃ¼ldÃ¶tt␀␀<h3>Sound alert</h3>␀␀␀␀<h3>HangjelzÃ©s</h3>␀␀␀␀Sound alert when "Ventilate" appears</label><label>Volume (plays when chosen; save with the button below)</label>␀␀␀HangjelzÃ©s, amikor megjelenik a "SzellÅ‘ztess"</label><label>HangerÅ‘ (vÃ¡lasztÃ¡skor megszÃ³lal; mentÃ©s a lenti gombbal)</label>␀' selected>␀MeghallgatÃ¡s␀␀␀<p style='color:#aaa;margin:0'>Silent during the night mode period (by clock or by sunset, see above), even if dimming is off. Also adjustable on the display: Settings / System.</p>␀␀␀<p style='color:#aaa;margin:0'>Az Ã©jszakai mÃ³d idÅ‘szakÃ¡ban (Ã³ra vagy napnyugta szerint, lÃ¡sd fent) nem szÃ³l, akkor sem, ha a sÃ¶tÃ©tÃ­tÃ©s ki van kapcsolva. A kijelzÅ‘n is Ã¡llÃ­thatÃ³: BeÃ¡llÃ­tÃ¡sok / Rendszer.</p>␀<h3>Forwarding to another display</h3><p style='color:#aaa;margin:0'>This display forwards the data received from the consoles unchanged to the <i>/ecowitt</i> address of the given display (e.g. idojaras-p4.local or 192.168.1.50). If the target is not reachable, this display keeps working normally. Phone notifications need to be set up on one display only.</p>␀␀<h3>TovÃ¡bbkÃ¼ldÃ©s mÃ¡sik kijelzÅ‘re</h3><p style='color:#aaa;margin:0'>A konzoloktÃ³l kapott adatokat ez a kijelzÅ‘ vÃ¡ltozatlanul tovÃ¡bbkÃ¼ldi a megadott kijelzÅ‘ <i>/ecowitt</i> cÃ­mÃ©re (pl. idojaras-p4.local vagy 192.168.1.50). Ha a cÃ©l nem Ã©rhetÅ‘ el, ennek a kijelzÅ‘nek a mÅ±kÃ¶dÃ©se nem vÃ¡ltozik. Telefonos Ã©rtesÃ­tÃ©st elÃ©g az egyiken beÃ¡llÃ­tani.</p>␀␀␀Forwarding on</label><label>Target (host name or IP)</label>␀␀␀␀TovÃ¡bbkÃ¼ldÃ©s bekapcsolva</label><label>CÃ©l (gÃ©pnÃ©v vagy IP)</label>␀␀␀'><p style='color:#aaa;margin:0'>Last forward: ␀'><p style='color:#aaa;margin:0'>UtolsÃ³ tovÃ¡bbkÃ¼ldÃ©s: ␀␀%s (successful: %u, failed: %u, dropped: %u)␀␀␀␀%s (sikeres: %u, hibÃ¡s: %u, elmaradt: %u)␀␀no target set␀␀␀nincs megadva cÃ©l␀␀off␀kikapcsolva␀<h3>Password</h3>␀␀␀<h3>JelszÃ³</h3>␀␀␀␀Change password</label><input type='password' name='newpw' id='newpw' maxlength='32' autocomplete='new-password' disabled placeholder='new password (empty: no password)'><input type='password' name='newpw2' id='newpw2' maxlength='32' autocomplete='new-password' disabled placeholder='new password again'><p style='color:#aaa;margin:0'>Password now: ␀␀␀JelszÃ³ mÃ³dosÃ­tÃ¡sa</label><input type='password' name='newpw' id='newpw' maxlength='32' autocomplete='new-password' disabled placeholder='Ãºj jelszÃ³ (Ã¼resen hagyva: nincs jelszÃ³)'><input type='password' name='newpw2' id='newpw2' maxlength='32' autocomplete='new-password' disabled placeholder='Ãºj jelszÃ³ mÃ©g egyszer'><p style='color:#aaa;margin:0'>JelszÃ³ most: ␀set (user name: admin)␀␀be van Ã¡llÃ­tva (felhasznÃ¡lÃ³nÃ©v: admin)␀nincs␀␀␀Save settings</button><p style='color:#aaa;margin:0'>Saves the location, time zone, rooms, night mode, notifications, forwarding and (if ticked) the password at once.</p></form><form method='POST' action='/ntfytest'><button type='submit' style='background:#444;color:#eee'>Send a test message to the phone</button></form><p style='color:#aaa;margin:0'>The test message goes to the topic already saved.</p><p style='color:#aaa'>The location is needed for sunrise/sunset and the forecast. The IP lookup queries ipwho.is from your browser (fallback: ip-api.com); it is only accurate to a city (often the provider's location), check it before saving.</p>␀␀BeÃ¡llÃ­tÃ¡sok mentÃ©se</button><p style='color:#aaa;margin:0'>Egyszerre menti a helyet, az idÅ‘zÃ³nÃ¡t, a helyisÃ©geket, az Ã©jszakai mÃ³dot, az Ã©rtesÃ­tÃ©seket, a tovÃ¡bbkÃ¼ldÃ©st Ã©s (ha bepipÃ¡ltad) a jelszÃ³t.</p></form><form method='POST' action='/ntfytest'><button type='submit' style='background:#444;color:#eee'>PrÃ³baÃ¼zenet kÃ¼ldÃ©se a telefonra</button></form><p style='color:#aaa;margin:0'>A prÃ³baÃ¼zenet a mÃ¡r elmentett tÃ©mÃ¡ra megy.</p><p style='color:#aaa'>A hely a napkelte/napnyugtÃ¡hoz Ã©s az elÅ‘rejelzÃ©shez kell. Az IP alapÃº keresÃ©s a bÃ¶ngÃ©szÅ‘dbÅ‘l kÃ©rdezi le az ipwho.is-t (tartalÃ©k: ip-api.com); ez csak vÃ¡rosnyi pontossÃ¡gÃº (gyakran a szolgÃ¡ltatÃ³ kÃ¶zpontja), mentÃ©s elÅ‘tt ellenÅ‘rizd.</p>␀var L=['The two passwords do not match.','Searching...','Found: ',' - check it before saving!','Failed: none of the location services is reachable.'];␀␀var L=['A kÃ©t jelszÃ³ nem egyezik.','KeresÃ©s...','TalÃ¡lat: ',' - mentÃ©s elÅ‘tt ellenÅ‘rizd!','Nem sikerÃ¼lt: egyik helykeresÅ‘ szolgÃ¡ltatÃ¡s sem Ã©rhetÅ‘ el.'];␀␀␀<h3>Firmware update</h3><p>Choose the <b>.bin</b> file (the release's <i>â€¦-ota.bin</i> file, or built with PlatformIO: <i>.pio/build/&lt;environment&gt;/firmware.bin</i>).</p>␀␀␀<h3>Firmware frissÃ­tÃ©s</h3><p>VÃ¡laszd ki a <b>.bin</b> fÃ¡jlt (a kiadÃ¡s <i>â€¦-ota.bin</i> fÃ¡jlja, vagy PlatformIO-val fordÃ­tva: <i>.pio/build/&lt;kÃ¶rnyezet&gt;/firmware.bin</i>).</p>␀␀Upload␀␀FeltÃ¶ltÃ©s␀In progress...␀␀Folyamatban...␀␀<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset='utf-8'><meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'><title>Ecowitt Weather Display</title><style>body{font-family:sans-serif;background:#121212;color:#eee;max-width:480px;margin:30px auto;padding:0 16px}input,button{font-size:18px;margin:14px 0;width:100%}button{padding:12px;background:#ff8a3d;border:0;border-radius:8px;color:#000;cursor:pointer;transition:filter .1s,transform .1s}button:active{filter:brightness(1.4);transform:scale(.97)}button:disabled{opacity:.6}</style></head><body><h2>Ecowitt Weather Display</h2><p>␀␀␀Kamera: ␀␀␀␀, CO2 %d ppm␀␀␀␀%04d.%02d.%02d %02d:%02d - %s<br>␀␀␀<span style='font-family:monospace;font-size:13px'>␀</span></p><form method='POST' action='/clearcrash'><button type='submit' style='background:#555;color:#eee'>␀␀␀</button></form>␀␀␀␀<h3>WiFi</h3><p>␀␀␀␀</p><form method='POST' action='/wifiset' id='wf'><button type='button' id='wsb' style='background:#444;color:#eee'>␀␀␀␀</button><select id='wsl' style='font-size:18px;width:100%;margin:6px 0'><option value=''>␀␀</option></select><label>␀␀␀</label><input name='ssid' id='wss' maxlength='32' required><label>␀</label><input name='pass' id='wsp' type='password' maxlength='64' autocomplete='new-password'><label style='display:block'><input type='checkbox' id='wsv' style='width:auto;margin:0 8px 0 0'>␀␀␀␀</label><button type='submit'>␀␀</button></form><p style='color:#aaa;margin:0'>␀</p><form method='POST' action='/wifiportal'><button type='submit' style='background:#444;color:#eee'>␀␀</button></form><script>(function(){var l=document.getElementById('wsl'),s=document.getElementById('wss'),p=document.getElementById('wsp');document.getElementById('wsv').onchange=function(){p.type=this.checked?'text':'password';};l.onchange=function(){if(l.value)s.value=l.value;};␀␀␀document.getElementById('wsb').onclick=function(){var b=this;b.textContent=T[0];fetch('/wifiscan').then(function(x){return x.json();}).then(function(a){l.innerHTML='';a.forEach(function(n){var o=document.createElement('option');o.value=n.s;o.textContent=n.s+' ('+n.r+' dBm'+(n.l?T[1]:T[2])+')';l.appendChild(o);});if(a.length){s.value=a[0].s;}b.textContent=T[3];}).catch(function(){b.textContent=T[4];});};})();</script>␀␀␀␀<input name='lat' id='lat' inputmode='decimal' value='␀␀<input name='lon' id='lon' inputmode='decimal' valu